<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-16T04:46:42.138Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:46:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi missiles struck the Yemeni presidential palace in Aden, killing five ministers and injuring many, and also hit the Saudi-led forces headquarters there. The Houthis are now virtually independent in weapons production, while Red Sea attacks are threatening Saudi Arabia, holy sites and global trade, prompting India to call for seafarer safety at the UN. Migrants continue risking sea journeys to reach Yemen despite the heightened danger. The conflict produced 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/15/houthi-missiles-strike-aden-yemen&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/16/future-western-security-at-stake-yemen-civil-war-former-pm&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/15/why-are-migrants-risking-their-lives-at-sea-to-reach-yemen?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/15/world/middleeast/yemen-strike-aden-palace.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm62y6lp73zdo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQOHFYODkyZGFuWjRiaWN0TDdxQVBOaGpRYlR0QmEwTi1YaWhKZ3dBSXhGQXhzUHRPV0hsT1YyYzlIUmEwT3hxWkZqMVVJTFh1Q21IVmVoTkpQYjhnWnFRclBhVmt6T2RPaFV0N0d3NExHd3NxWllTWUpSSTdBNVM3Znc2OWZrM0c3QlE2MW5HMXdUU20zQ09pSnhRTzdQamhrOFZFWFBxZG5nUEZ1Nk1lNFVSbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;RFI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ianslive.in/india-expresses-solidarity-with-saudi-arabia-under-attack-from-houthis--20261016080303&quot;&gt;ianslive.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.livemint.com/news/india/petrol-and-diesel-prices-today-october-16-